Descriptor AdministrativeFundingControl
    documentation 'This descriptor holds the type of education institution as classified by its 
    'funding source (e.g., public or private).
    with optional map type
        item Public School
            documentation 'A school supported wholly or largely by public funds.
        item Private School
            documentation 'A school supported wholly or largely by private organizations or private 
            'individuals.
        item Other
            documentation 'Other funding classification.